DF-1  FORMs holds the 35 drawing fields, the 28 form attributes and the two top-level forms defined here (65).
      (utilities loads Topics/forms; including it here as well would define every field twice.)
DF-2  three definitions as printed: LinE and WidtH carry their Core Graphics function and signature, X is there.
